# Where the demo form POSTs its JSON. Without it the form falls back to opening the
# visitor's email app addressed to sales@chaidepot.ca — which works, but loses anyone
# without a mail client set up. Any form service that accepts a JSON POST will do.
#
# Local: copy this file to .env and fill it in. Deployed: set it as a repository
# variable (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables), which the Pages
# workflow passes to the build.
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
